{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"## Compaction checkpoint 2 — 2026-08-13 ~04:30 UTC (bug-bash session 6f8df6b5)\n\n### Scoreboard\n~85+ Gerrit changes merged, ~80 tickets resolved since bash start. Bugs open/in_progress: 0. Code-scanning alerts: 0 repo-wide.\n\n### In flight at checkpoint (agent → ticket → change)\n- arcticseal agent → unsinful-cliffy-arcticseal (config-driven 8k cap + save-time warning) → suite pre-push.\n- equine agent → blueblack-piecemeal-equine (atomic ticket-dir creation) → change 1696 in CI.\n- pony driver → epic vigilant-erasable-pony: lion CLOSED (1684); swan (repressive-delectable-swan) change 1693 final patchset pending Verified; then hamadryas+shrew (plans pre-condensed <8k, anchors verified) → mutt → graywolf (live-run ACs operator-dispatchable only).\n- despotic driver → epic despotic-floriated-leopard: S1+S2 CLOSED (1672 c638bc6947, 1683 3476af3d52); S4 (timeless-elusive-joey) implemented, suite pre-push; S3 (cinematic-untiring-dunnart) blocked on S4; then epic close.\n- murrelet agent → salted-growable-murrelet (resolved_statuses hard removal, operator-approved) → implementing.\n- basenji investigator → thin-broadish-basenji (verifier stale-read/parse-fail; 3 incidents, hypothesis 3 = parse-failure-as-FAIL best supported) → will retry asianlion's blocked close as live validation.\n- wailsome-unsure-asianlion: work COMPLETE, close blocked by the basenji defect. Operator question pending: --force authorization vs wait for basenji (recommendation: wait).\n- fixable-angular-caribou: deferred-open by design (1 char over cap; closes trivially after arcticseal lands).\n\n### Queued next\nwolverine story (expectation enum, needs dedicated implementer), defaceable-icy-antelope (fsck.py 800-cap split), then epic wildebeast (outrageous-uncultured-wildebeast, 12 children) after despotic+pony close and its depends_on/peer-claim check.\n\n### Pending operator decisions\n1. asianlion --force vs wait (above). 2. P3.0 blocking-lane re-enable (code-review blocking lane unplugged: 1 criterion enabled, 0.95 threshold unreachable; analysis in session log cosey-vinegarish-mouflon entry 1). 3. CV architecture shortlist re-commission (partially retracted as unverified; the proven fix landed as 1656). 4. Live External Integration re-green dispatch (validates region fix + anthropic credential + DC cells in one run).\n\n### Landed highlights since checkpoint 1\nLock family (retry cc69cc1179, pid-recycle bound, close-signature honesty, force-reason recording); bridge delivery trio + ACLI auth fast-abort + silent link-divergence fix (--yes); CV false-unmet fix proven 4/4→0/4 (1656 e1352535ac); advisory findings now published on Gerrit (1691 72682442fc — visibility starts post-redeploy); complexity-lock merge-base fix (1682); mutation-gate observability (1633); alarm-metric false-positive fixes (1686 cold-start, 1690 anchoring); DEPLOY_DEFER_MAX 2400s (1687); bridge_run_failures alarm live+verified (1688); three deprecation removals (1679/1689/1694); plan-v5 kind sets (1635); attach-commits verb (1644); debris swept (fsck 16→7) + atomic-creation fix in CI; both Jira epics dinosaur CLOSED, despotic/pony past half.\n\n### Infra/env facts\nJIRA_API_TOKEN + ANTHROPIC_API_KEY rotated (operator). Bridge healthy. bridge-metrics OIDC role applied; repo vars set; alarm OK with 13× 0.0 datapoints. caffeinate holds host awake. Hourly sweep cron :23; central Gerrit vote monitor live. Records rule (operator): stable lessons→docs, task-scoped→tickets, session records→session logs, fast-changing fleet state→proposed notice primitive (idea ticket ununbium-protective-silverfox).\n\n### CI playbook (current)\nStale-base ('invalid choice: select', complexity-baseline drift in untouched files, baseline entries from main drift) → REBASE never recheck. TLS/promisor cert flake → recheck with reasoning. comment-hygiene (run-ids/bare dates) → real fix, cite ticket aliases. module-size/env-registry/config-read/uv-lock/ADR-index → real, regenerate + verify vs `git archive HEAD`. bugfix-size-attestation → earn signed plan attestation (batch plan edits, re-review LAST), then `rerun-llm-review`. Two-clone push-race + maintenance.lock flakes FIXED (1676/1647). Run CI's full local gate set: ten check_* gates, six generators, CI's exact pytest invocation. NEVER git stash. Verify vs gerrit remote (GitHub mirror lags). Terse ACs, evidence in comments; [operator-attested] only for genuinely external evidence.\n\n### Other sessions (hands off)\nbroke-boarish-hagfish epic (e9c8), ethnogenic-centaurian-rat T15 epic (a8e73; note its child geode-amazing-peafowl is in_progress with NO session — possible abandonment, flagged to operator), mutation-session tickets."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786589143120913001,"uuid":"3bf60c8d-23e6-4301-a908-4d1566b83bfd"}